SUMMARY:Godzilla Minus Zero
LOCATION:Images Cinema\, 50 Spring St\, Williamstown\, MA 01267
DESCRIPTION:Times: 3:15pm\, 6:30pm\, 9:45pm\nWar reduced Japan to zero\, an
 d Godzilla plunged it into minus. Two years have passed since then\, and t
 he country has faced agonizing struggles to achieve recovery and finally r
 eclaim its daily life. Just as humanity managed to cling to a hard-won pea
 ce\, a new threat strikes\, crushing hope in an instant.\nhttps://www.imag
 escinema.org/movie/godzilla-minus-zero\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https:/
 /pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.imagescinema.org/movie/godzilla-minus-zero
END:VEVENT
